Spec: SpecDD File Type

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Define IntelliJ file type metadata for SpecDD `.sdd` files.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDFileType.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDFileType.kt

Can read:
  /src/main/resources/META-INF/logo.svg
  /src/main/resources/META-INF/plugin.xml
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDLanguageBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Use `SpecDDLanguage` as the file type language.
  Use `SpecDD` as the file type name.
  Use `SpecDD specification file` as the file type description.
  Use `sdd` as the default extension.
  Use the packaged `META-INF/logo.svg` resource as the file type icon.
  Remain an instantiable class for IntelliJ extension point compatibility.

Must not:
  Be a Kotlin object.
  Define syntax highlighting behavior.
  Define validation diagnostics.
  Add user-facing settings.
